<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-W.P. 105-1 AT LUNCH AGAINST BOLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-W.P. 105-1 AT LUNCH AGAINST BOLAND.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province were 105 for one at lunch on second day of their Supersport Series match against Boland at Newlands on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Province 105-1 in 30 overs (Sven Koenig 68 not out, Desmond Haynes 33).</p>
